Package: eansearch
Type: Package
Title: EAN, UPC and ISBN Lookup and Validation via the 'EAN-Search.org'
        API
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jan", "Willamowius", email = "info@relaxedcommunications.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Relaxed Communications GmbH", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Client for the 'EAN-Search.org' barcode database API
    <https://www.ean-search.org/>. Look up product names and details for EAN,
    UPC and ISBN barcodes, search products by name, category or barcode prefix,
    map EANs to Amazon Standard Identification Numbers (ASIN) and Library of
    Congress Control Numbers (LCCN) and back, verify barcode checksums, find
    the country where a barcode was issued and generate PNG barcode images.
    An API access token is required, see
    <https://www.ean-search.org/ean-database-api.html>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/eansearch/r-eansearch,
        https://www.ean-search.org/
BugReports: https://github.com/eansearch/r-eansearch/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: curl, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.1.7)
